+## Supported currencies
+
+tally accepts amounts in the following currencies:
+
+| Code | Currency         |
+|------|-----------------|
+| USD  | US Dollar        |
+| EUR  | Euro             |
+| GBP  | British Pound    |
+| SGD  | Singapore Dollar |
+| JPY  | Japanese Yen     |
+| INR  | Indian Rupee     |
+
+All amounts are converted to USD at storage time using the rates in `tally/rates.py`. USD is the default when no `--currency` flag is given.
+
